        <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
            <h1 style="font-size: 36px;">Design and principle of operation</h1>
            <p>The supervision relay TCS is designed to be used for the supervision of trip circuits and other important control and monitoring circuits. Block diagram of the relay is shown in Fig. 1. The supervision function is based on low-level (< 3 mA) current injection principle.</p>
            <p>The injected current is sensed by two opto-couplers. The supervision function in three steady states of circuit breaker-trip circuit can be seen in Fig. 2, 3 and 4. In normal condition the indicator LED glows green and output relays are in picked-up condition.</p>
            <p>If in the event of a fault, the measuring current goes below the operating value of the relay</p>
        </div>
